Let text be "(()".
Let last be the last position of text.
Let best be 0.
For every start from 0 to last.
Let balance be 0.
For every end from start to last.
If character end of text is 40, add 1 to balance.
If character end of text is 41, subtract 1 from balance.
If balance is less than 0, break.
If balance is 0, let width be end minus start plus 1, if width is more than best, set best to width.

Print best.
